      {
        "id": "J2V4-SEC-02",
        "order": 2,
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "怎样看世界、认识和社会",
        "guidingQuestion": "哲学部分主要在回答哪些问题？",
        "narrativeSegments": [
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "takeaway",
            "label": "",
            "text": "哲学部分提供理解世界、认识和社会历史的基本观察角度。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "世界",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "认识",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "社会历史",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u021:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u023:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u029:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u030:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u021:b002",
                "quote": "1.哲学的基本问题：哲学的基本问题是思维与存在的关系问题，即意识与物质的关系问题。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "eb5ede6a8896467aba5744b66f2bccca01f8e1e2f7e09ab9de48a61ea1c593ec"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u023:b002",
                "quote": "联系和发展的观点是唯物辩证法的总观点和总特征。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "bd9846717a268066f2848c179184119bdbb830d72c22579497ecf0e90e4f8462"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u029:b002",
                "quote": "1.真理的含义：真理是标志主观与客观相符合的范畴，是人们对客观事物及其规律的正确认识。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "e2314ca5ebf15db232df9de9e981523a2e8563ac8879bba3e4fadd920e4d95c2"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u030:b002",
                "quote": "1.社会历史观的基本问题：社会存在和社会意识的关系问题是社会历史观的基本问题，对这一问题的不同回答，是唯物史观和唯心史观的根本分歧所在。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "809674b1c6efb39113a02056d06af778fd98152e5214279628f0c9665ae73eed"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "世界是什么",
            "text": "从物质与意识的关系，认识唯物主义和唯心主义的分歧。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "物质与意识",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u021:b003",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u022:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u021:b003",
                "quote": "（1）物质和意识何者为第一性的问题：对这一问题的不同回答，是唯物主义和唯心主义的根本分歧所在。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "77c1b4ffd870c78bc777785e934f05d34c473173a16e4a54c412c15aab49d732"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u022:b002",
                "quote": "1.物质：物质是标志客观实在的哲学范畴，客观实在性是物质的唯一特性。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "6c984d9406683d7b4037b5cdb2932da0dd7e35e7bdafb3e19e18b9b0c4c0bca1"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u021",
              "politics-toc-v2-u022"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "事物怎样变化",
            "text": "从联系、发展看变化，认识矛盾、量变质变、否定之否定三条基本规律。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "联系、发展",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "矛盾",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "量变质变",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "否定之否定",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u023:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u024:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u025:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u026:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u023:b002",
                "quote": "联系和发展的观点是唯物辩证法的总观点和总特征。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "bd9846717a268066f2848c179184119bdbb830d72c22579497ecf0e90e4f8462"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u024:b002",
                "quote": "对立统一规律又称矛盾规律，矛盾是反映客观事物内部或不同事物之间对立统一关系的哲学范畴。对立统一规律揭示了事物发展的源泉和动力，是唯物辩证法的实质和核心。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "101f74e20ade35db946d4c9b65abb3e70d0ed192d6f86d027065cd36b6d62db8"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u025:b002",
                "quote": "量变质变规律揭示了事物发展的形式和状态。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "87d6fb75bf683ad4e4af8de6c365e642b13f81d1f74cc422b4acab1a1fd71773"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u026:b002",
                "quote": "否定之否定规律揭示了事物发展的方向和道路。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "4d12baaabe11dcb9238fe54e93f39ea28bfa6f1b39c42626ed413eaa32dee1d6"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u023",
              "politics-toc-v2-u024",
              "politics-toc-v2-u025",
              "politics-toc-v2-u026"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "认识怎样形成",
            "text": "在实践中形成认识，由感性到理性，再回到实践；真理关注认识是否符合客观事物及其规律。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "实践",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "真理",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u027:b012",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u028:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u029:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u027:b012",
                "quote": "①实践是认识的来源。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "9c3c66579d0c8e67126c7e345e40b9e0fc1d3ccefd142acc2d8033cb2143b36b"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u028:b002",
                "quote": "认识的辩证过程就是在实践基础上由感性认识到理性认识（第一次飞跃）、又由理性认识到实践（第二次飞跃）的能动飞跃。第二次飞跃，更为重要、更有意义。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "529bb21ca8f5f536ddee96ffbe9862d7ebbcaaee20adfe5b01a4244a17a6ea28"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u029:b002",
                "quote": "1.真理的含义：真理是标志主观与客观相符合的范畴，是人们对客观事物及其规律的正确认识。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "e2314ca5ebf15db232df9de9e981523a2e8563ac8879bba3e4fadd920e4d95c2"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u027",
              "politics-toc-v2-u028",
              "politics-toc-v2-u029"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "社会怎样发展",
            "text": "从社会存在与社会意识、社会基本矛盾、人民群众，认识历史发展的条件、规律和主体。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "社会基本矛盾",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "人民群众",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u030:b003",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u031:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u032:b003"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u030:b003",
                "quote": "唯物史观（历史唯物主义）认为社会存在决定社会意识。唯心史观（历史唯心主义）认为社会意识决定社会存在。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "cffb91943463e36094ac933c757d97df1dda7fcd0f3eb65ae1b923822f3b3a12"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u031:b002",
                "quote": "社会历史发展的基本规律指社会的基本矛盾运动，社会基本矛盾包括生产力与生产关系的矛盾、经济基础与上层建筑的矛盾。社会基本矛盾是社会历史发展的根本动力。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "075e17df2b5384bb6bcd85563c110d3411b196d4a011670668822bd097da880a"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u032:b003",
                "quote": "群众史观：认为对历史发展起决定作用的是人民群众，但是也承认个人尤其是少数历史人物的作用。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "36cbdcb1ad5ed88c5c2877656601f628d64726b5a59f7b2c8bbd122f331c35a5"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u030",
              "politics-toc-v2-u031",
              "politics-toc-v2-u032"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "label",
            "role": "note",
            "label": "接下来",
            "text": "基本原理还包括政治经济学，接着看它关注哪些内容。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          }
        ],
        "structureFocusNodeIds": [
          "politics-toc-v2-n024"
        ],
        "detailTargets": [],
        "nextLabel": "看政治经济学",
        "shortTitle": "哲学部分"
      },
      {
        "id": "J2V4-SEC-03",
        "order": 3,
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "政治经济学在讲什么",
        "guidingQuestion": "当前政治经济学内容有哪些关键知识？",
        "narrativeSegments": [
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "takeaway",
            "label": "",
            "text": "从商品与劳动出发，初步认识价值、货币和剩余价值。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "商品与劳动",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "价值、货币和剩余价值",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u033:b003",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u034:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u035:b004",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u037:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u033:b003",
                "quote": "商品的二因素是使用价值和价值。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "4af0784199a368884ce4878b388e8b188d75a027f20ad9731b38d139f39c3066"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u034:b002",
                "quote": "劳动二重性学说是理解马克思政治经济学理论的枢纽。劳动二重性是指生产商品的劳动既是具体劳动，又是抽象劳动。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "3ce451ff36ce71a8f5a07ff78910363eb03b5ec86860fdfc9c518b9e0f9a40ac"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u035:b004",
                "quote": "商品的价值是凝结在商品中的无差别的一般人类劳动，价值量是由劳动者生产商品所耗费的劳动量决定的，而劳动量则按照劳动时间计算。决定商品价值量的不是生产商品的个别劳动时间，而是社会必要劳动时间。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "522d240c6d6e539d2ecfe8136b5cd484f714f22e16a2e98cfbd75268d44bcada"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b002",
                "quote": "1.货币的本质：货币是固定地充当一般等价物的商品。货币的本质是一般等价物。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "9fbe5e514199f4e0375742c5dc84e6ffee44e8b0dcbbe0dc30ec64201626a2fb"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u037:b002",
                "quote": "剩余价值学说阐明了资本主义经济制度的本质，剩余价值规律是资本主义的基本规律。剩余价值是雇佣工人所创造的并被资本家无偿占有的超过劳动力价值的那部分价值，它体现了资本家与雇佣工人之间剥削与被剥削的关系。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "6a7d762053b1b6d0751a16cca3fcc529b8ff3d2594b6f04a8e8712f65dfdf324"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "商品",
            "text": "商品的二因素是使用价值和价值。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "使用价值和价值",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u033:b003"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u033:b003",
                "quote": "商品的二因素是使用价值和价值。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "4af0784199a368884ce4878b388e8b188d75a027f20ad9731b38d139f39c3066"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u033"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "劳动",
            "text": "具体劳动与抽象劳动是同一劳动过程的两个方面。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "具体劳动与抽象劳动",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u034:b005"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u034:b005",
                "quote": "3.具体劳动和抽象劳动的辩证关系：具体劳动和抽象劳动是商品生产者同一劳动过程中不可分割的两个方面，而不是两次或者两种劳动。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "7d0733aee92748430ed513be0a1933b869b2d44d0ddcdcb9a5eb7513ed390cc5"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u034"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "价值量",
            "text": "商品价值量由社会必要劳动时间决定。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "社会必要劳动时间",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u035:b004"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u035:b004",
                "quote": "商品的价值是凝结在商品中的无差别的一般人类劳动，价值量是由劳动者生产商品所耗费的劳动量决定的，而劳动量则按照劳动时间计算。决定商品价值量的不是生产商品的个别劳动时间，而是社会必要劳动时间。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "522d240c6d6e539d2ecfe8136b5cd484f714f22e16a2e98cfbd75268d44bcada"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u035"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "货币",
            "text": "货币的本质是一般等价物，还具有多种职能。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "一般等价物",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b005",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b007"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b002",
                "quote": "1.货币的本质：货币是固定地充当一般等价物的商品。货币的本质是一般等价物。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "9fbe5e514199f4e0375742c5dc84e6ffee44e8b0dcbbe0dc30ec64201626a2fb"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b005",
                "quote": "价值尺度：货币表现其他一切商品是否具有价值和衡量其价值量大小的职能。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "55538070dd61f57ce288b5a03f812f58118ac96e61818abf5d1dea4cb9e9758f"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u036:b007",
                "quote": "流通手段：货币在商品流通中充当交换媒介借以实现商品价值的职能。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "a2d5e0e094becb10739cfe6d8aa65dc7b8c227a68bcfde14bd231523c2260ffa"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u036"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "剩余价值",
            "text": "雇佣工人创造、被资本家无偿占有的超过劳动力价值的那部分价值。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "超过劳动力价值",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u037:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u037:b002",
                "quote": "剩余价值学说阐明了资本主义经济制度的本质，剩余价值规律是资本主义的基本规律。剩余价值是雇佣工人所创造的并被资本家无偿占有的超过劳动力价值的那部分价值，它体现了资本家与雇佣工人之间剥削与被剥削的关系。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "6a7d762053b1b6d0751a16cca3fcc529b8ff3d2594b6f04a8e8712f65dfdf324"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u037"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "label",
            "role": "note",
            "label": "",
            "text": "这里先认识概念，不展开计算、生产方法比较或应用题。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "label",
            "role": "note",
            "label": "接下来",
            "text": "看过基础理论，再认识另一条主线：新时代思想。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          }
        ],
        "structureFocusNodeIds": [
          "politics-toc-v2-n024"
        ],
        "detailTargets": [],
        "nextLabel": "看新时代思想",
        "shortTitle": "政治经济学"
      },
      {
        "id": "J2V4-SEC-04",
        "order": 4,
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "主要表述各起什么作用",
        "guidingQuestion": "熟悉的数字表述各自承担什么作用？",
        "narrativeSegments": [
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "takeaway",
            "label": "",
            "text": "核心要义是坚持和发展中国特色社会主义。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "坚持和发展中国特色社会主义",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u001:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u001:b002",
                "quote": "坚持和发展中国特色社会主义，是改革开放以来我们党全部理论和实践的鲜明主题，也是习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的核心要义。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "4de506706e604818c3ea731153c579e53507935fc8001f40b24323403a12048f"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u001"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "理论内容",
            "text": "“十个明确”集中体现主体理论内容。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "十个明确",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b004"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b004",
                "quote": "1.十个明确：“十个明确”是习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的主体内容，集中体现了这一思想体系的主要观点和基本精神，构成了这一思想体系的四梁八柱，发挥着统摄作用。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "d625a9857cebc60cfbfbea493c42a00fab96e57dd869746ef74e86bdfc430609"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u003"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "基本方略",
            "text": "“十四个坚持”概括基本方略。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "十四个坚持",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b015"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b015",
                "quote": "2.十四个坚持：“十四个坚持”是在治国理政各方面作出的理论分析和政策指导，构成了新时代坚持和发展中国特色社会主义的基本方略。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "7390ce900c93c6514f8bbdd3473dbe6a0009125d991fcc3649991b027e6bbfa1"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "实践成果",
            "text": "“十三个方面成就”总结理论与实践成果。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "十三个方面成就",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b017"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b017",
                "quote": "3.十三个方面成就：“十三个方面成就”对新时代伟大实践进行了科学总结，全景式地展示了习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的理论与实践成果。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "a26902f4f6c6bfeec421da790bd2d71a9bc62611223e3ee5d444ce7af049f8c7"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "方法论",
            "text": "“六个必须坚持”体现世界观和方法论。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "六个必须坚持",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b018"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u003:b018",
                "quote": "4.六个必须坚持：“六个必须坚持”是习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想的世界观、方法论和贯穿其中的立场观点方法的重要体现。“六个必须坚持”就是必须坚持人民至上、必须坚持自信自立、必须坚持守正创新、必须坚持问题导向、必须坚持系统观念、必须坚持胸怀天下。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "996da3018073789d3c5a837b0186032c477a211776e9f136d9dea65f8c62df30"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "label",
            "role": "note",
            "label": "",
            "text": "先分清各自作用，不在这里展开每组具体条目。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          },
          {
            "type": "label",
            "role": "note",
            "label": "接下来",
            "text": "分清主要表述的作用，再看它向哪些实践领域展开。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [],
            "coverageUnitIds": []
          }
        ],
        "structureFocusNodeIds": [
          "politics-toc-v2-n002"
        ],
        "detailTargets": [],
        "nextLabel": "看实践全景",
        "shortTitle": "思想体系"
      },
      {
        "id": "J2V4-SEC-05",
        "order": 5,
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "怎样向现实领域展开",
        "guidingQuestion": "当前资料中的实践内容覆盖哪些方面？",
        "narrativeSegments": [
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "takeaway",
            "label": "",
            "text": "以中国式现代化全面推进中华民族伟大复兴，党的领导、以人民为中心贯穿实践展开。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "中国式现代化",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "党的领导",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              },
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "以人民为中心",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u004:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u005:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u006:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u004:b002",
                "quote": "党的二十大报告指出，中国共产党的中心任务是团结带领全国各族人民全面建成社会主义现代化强国、实现第二个百年奋斗目标，以中国式现代化全面推进中华民族伟大复兴。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "e666f736e8de12fd7fe7ae21dcecad0203e7704beb109c3f2a61962b200e8dad"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u005:b002",
                "quote": "一、中国共产党领导是中国特色社会主义最本质的特征",
                "sourceTextSha256": "8fe19d0e9c765d8cb8874673f437dbe4ea3d3dfd937faa1d87862360b16ecff1"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u006:b002",
                "quote": "一、坚持人民至上",
                "sourceTextSha256": "9e4083009f106bd342a103b05bfe343ae32109cf221554c97789ea38ba2056cc"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u004",
              "politics-toc-v2-u005",
              "politics-toc-v2-u006"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "发展与民生",
            "text": "高质量发展、保障和改善民生，教育、科技、人才提供基础性、战略性支撑。",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "part": "text",
                "quote": "高质量发展",
                "occurrence": 1,
                "role": "key"
              }
            ],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u007:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u010:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u015:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u007:b002",
                "quote": "高质量发展是全面建设社会主义现代化国家的首要任务，是我国经济社会发展的主题。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "cc06775302aab954cee4e96033798ad1be31def0a873088dab1beb33b7c99708"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u010:b002",
                "quote": "为民造福是立党为公、执政为民的本质要求，要把增进民生福祉作为发展的根本目的。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "5772ecad8c541ea1cbf053fc52eb838ce99f2bd391cd5bb53f798183c53ce1e4"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u015:b002",
                "quote": "教育、科技、人才是全面建设社会主义现代化国家的基础性、战略性支撑。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "faf42a46749707abf581791ffe38c28c7b68e3e1d686d981ee5d8cbf8daef9f8"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u007",
              "politics-toc-v2-u010",
              "politics-toc-v2-u015"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "民主法治与改革",
            "text": "全过程人民民主、全面依法治国、全面深化改革。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u008:b001",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u013:b002",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u012:b001"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u008:b001",
                "quote": "第四节 发展全过程人民民主",
                "sourceTextSha256": "474cae5d929e3ca55e0b16d5b227445132f50e9fba6a106a113bcd0c207d2570"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u013:b002",
                "quote": "全面依法治国是国家治理的一场深刻革命，是中国特色社会主义的本质要求和重要保障。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "e5eb5b918418bdf319859206f393c7e5ecb596375572485aa7ce47f98ee4a25a"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u012:b001",
                "quote": "第八节 全面深化改革",
                "sourceTextSha256": "62a194ade494abfef0f9524b5c96d80b2d300e15638f4f445eef4ffa2fcaafdf"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u008",
              "politics-toc-v2-u013",
              "politics-toc-v2-u012"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "文化与生态",
            "text": "建设社会主义文化强国、推进社会主义生态文明。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u009:b001",
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u011:b001"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u009:b001",
                "quote": "第五节 建设社会主义文化强国",
                "sourceTextSha256": "a9db91ff4fa29184c0dec7aa4888d4a2ab99cc2f8916398d5fe09dfc30fac01e"
              },
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u011:b001",
                "quote": "第七节 社会主义生态文明",
                "sourceTextSha256": "05f20799b6063d563fda67d3af792263bbfc1972d9df78f1b72eaa888b4f9e81"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u009",
              "politics-toc-v2-u011"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "党的建设",
            "text": "全面从严治党。",
            "emphasis": [],
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "block:politics-toc-v2-u014:b002"
            ],
            "sourceAtomRefIds": [],
            "sourceEvidence": [
              {
                "blockId": "block:politics-toc-v2-u014:b002",
                "quote": "全面从严治党是党永葆生机活力、走好新的赶考之路的必由之路，是新时代党的建设的鲜明主题。",
                "sourceTextSha256": "d303971fde1c7694be603b626ec22030d2a29a490ef208d8b72b357ba9125df7"
              }
            ],
            "coverageUnitIds": [
              "politics-toc-v2-u014"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "source",
            "role": "beat",
            "label": "安全统一与外交",
